reagent-name-e-z-nutrient = EZ nutrient
reagent-desc-e-z-nutrient = Give your plants some of those EZ nutrients! Dionas find this delicious.

reagent-name-left4-zed = left-4-zed
reagent-desc-left4-zed = A cocktail of mutagenic compounds that gives nutrients, harms and affects plant life's genome.

reagent-name-pest-killer = pest killer
reagent-desc-pest-killer = A mixture that targets pests. While useful it slowly poisons plants with toxins, be careful when using it.

reagent-name-plant-b-gone = plant-B-gone
reagent-desc-plant-b-gone = A harmful toxic mixture to kill plantlife. Very effective against kudzu.

reagent-name-robust-harvest = robust harvest
reagent-desc-robust-harvest = A highly effective fertilizer with a limited potency-boosting effect on plants. Use it cautiously, as excessive application can reduce plant yield. It has a particularly beneficial effect on dionas.

reagent-name-weed-killer = weed killer
reagent-desc-weed-killer = A mixture that targets weeds. Very effective against kudzu. While useful it slowly poisons plants with toxins, be careful when using it.

reagent-name-ammonia = ammonia
reagent-desc-ammonia = An effective fertilizer, it gives your plants some nutrients.

reagent-name-diethylamine = diethylamine
reagent-desc-diethylamine = A very potent fertilizer, treats plants with nutrients, eliminates pests, and sometimes it can even speed up growth.

reagent-name-sedin = sedin
reagent-desc-sedin = A modified version of diethylamine that can restore seeds on plants at the cost of potency.

reagent-name-rmcthymol = Thymol
reagent-desc-rmcthymol = Known chemical used in the 20th century as innovative way to combat hookworm parasites and generally all kinds of infections, it was since used as natural pesticide.

reagent-name-rmcpsoralen = Psoralen
reagent-desc-rmcpsoralen = Naturally occurring carcinogenic, used commonly as mutagen for DNA research.

reagent-name-rmcconiine = Coniine
reagent-desc-rmcconiine = Potent toxic chemical causing loss of consciousness and respiratory failure in matter of seconds, although it was studied for a long time, it could have some undocumented use.

reagent-name-rmczygacine = Zygacine
reagent-desc-rmczygacine = Causes convulsing of the heart muscles before blocking the contractions entirely.

reagent-name-rmcdigoxin = Digoxin
reagent-desc-rmcdigoxin = One of the oldest chemicals to enter field in treating many heart conditions, besides few sides effects, it can be used to great effect.

reagent-name-rmcurishiol = Urishiol
reagent-desc-rmcurishiol = Potent skin and tissue irritant causing burns which lasts weeks after the contact is made, commonly encountered in plants like Poison Ivy, Poison Oak, and similar toxicodendrons.

reagent-name-rmcatropine = Atropine
reagent-desc-rmcatropine = Plant based chemical replaced and superseded by Epinephrine, it has a plethora of side effects but is considerably stronger than epinephrine.

reagent-name-rmcphenol = Phenol
reagent-desc-rmcphenol = Skin analgesic used for targeted operation and mild pain relief of an area. While safe on the skin, extremely lethal on injection.
